<para id="RM000001LYP008X" category="C" type-id="801GF" name-id="950UQ-00" from="200612" to="200708">
<dtccode>U1002</dtccode>
<dtcname>Sub-network Communication Malfunction (CAN Gateway)</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001LYP008X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00000DN00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The CAN gateway ECU outputs the code when it cannot receive data from any of the V bus No.2 connected ECUs whose connection is stored in memory.</ptxt>
<ptxt>When a network malfunction (main line malfunction) occurs, the CAN gateway ECU may erase the stored code in order to restore communication.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.34in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.32in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U1002</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Data cannot be received from any of the ECUs whose connection is stored in the CAN gateway ECU memory</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Main line (1) open or short circuit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Short circuit in either branch wire (2) or (3)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open circuit in all branch wires (2) and (3)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN J/C internal short or open circuit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector terminal contact or contact pressure</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Network gateway computer (CAN gateway ECU) internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001LYP008X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00000DO00000">
